n scratch you! Yuck!\n\nSo, we put on our shieldy shield called a **Vaccine**! 🛡️\n\nA vaccine isn't just any old shield though. It's a special shield that has the germ's **claw** cut off! ✂️ No sharp claw!\n\nAnd it gives you a **tiny mark** on your shield so you know where the bad part went! 📝\n\nThen you wait... wait... wait... until your shield gets mad at the mark! \"Hey!\" says your shield. \"I'll get 'em!\" And boom! You're safe now! 🎉\n\nYour shield learns how to catch those mean germs! And now when they try to come back, your shield knows what to do! 🙌\n\nThat's why vaccines are good for you! They help your shield be strong and smart! 💪","modes_used":["eli5"],"generated_tokens":332,"seconds":79.745}]